{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> is divided into three parts proportional to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the smallest part is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31ff8ad02ccd47adc2e90203236296a2003c19de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5\\frac{1}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 11\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these answers}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"544\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given,\nThe ratios are 2:4:6 \nThe number is 64\n</p><p>So, the sum of the ratios is 12 \n</p><p>So, the first number is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/538bb94fb47723583fc91fe1906ebb021da38371.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\frac{64*2}{12}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />=<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a481b33fbe61bc5e66197e62402a0eca04f16b86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{32}{3}\\]\" width=\"18\" height=\"37\" /> \nSo, the second number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb891f77dca68db86c7cb8cf6298719b2f91052.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\frac{64*4}{12}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />=<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/5/775096796590a1929220999515dbbef617445098.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{64}{3}\\]\" width=\"18\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p>So, the third number is<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/7/6e73258f2cc0acdfc781ce9b6cbac5d940c72b77.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\frac{64*6}{12}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />=32\n</p>\n<pre>We can see that the smallest is<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbde17bcec0b15495ac8fa94c03977ce3379120d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\frac{32}{3}\\]\" width=\"38\" height=\"37\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/1043c6c601ac68380dd19040c4423e0c6dfc3d8e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{32}{3}=10 \\frac{2}{3}\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />\nwhich is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~Jayeed Mahmud (Bangladesh) 9/21/25\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the three numbers are in proportion to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe026d2e82458ab57c10457254ff8c0c0cf8dab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:4:6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, then they should also be in proportion to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68657d9fca2085bb50dfd198a2a8c34b3d9f90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:2:3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />. This implies that the three numbers can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. Add these values together to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/7/ec7b60c73cb5fd6028a9e6002fbd703e0de99e5d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+2x+3x=6x=64\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"14\" />\nDivide each side by 6 and get that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/a/d9a7ed04e834a6040f551968e811172b1bf633f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{64}{6}=\\frac{32}{3}=10 \\frac{2}{3}\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"37\" />\nwhich is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br />